sub- section (1) of section 92 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (34 of 2006), vide notification of the
Food Safety and Standards Authority of India number F.No. 5/15015/30/2011 dated the 18th April, 2013 in the
Gazette of India, Extraordinary, Part III, Section 4, inviting objections and suggestions from the persons likely
